&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelors, masters, or PhD in a technical field – Engineering, Statistics, Computer Science, Mathematics, Physics (or a related subject) must be completed upon employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in statistics and machine learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building mathematical models for complex real-world problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate programming skills in Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to react quickly and accurately to rapidly changing market conditions, including the ability to quickly and accurately respond and/or solve math and coding problems are essential functions of the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial experience is not a requirement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be graduating August 2027 or prior&lt;/li&gt;
