&lt;p&gt;Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding skills in probabilistic thinking and mathematical reasoning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive spirit and uncommon drive to learn and improve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appetite for risk-taking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated interest in financial markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reliable and predictable availability required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
