&lt;li&gt;Willingness to take ownership of his/her work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work both independently and collaboratively within a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong desire to deliver high quality results in a timely fashion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in the financial services industry is not required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
